110	Triple Counter
111	Your counter slashes three times.
112	Wind Footwork
113	Attack speed +40% for 5s after a parry.
114	Expose Weakness
115	A deep stab on one foe: it takes 30% more damage for 6s.
116	Deep Wound
117	Marked foes bleed.
118	Mark Transfer
119	When a marked foe falls, the mark jumps to a nearby foe.
120	Shadow Slash
121	Vanish and reappear like a shadow, slashing five nearby foes in turn. You can't be hit meanwhile.
122	Seven Slashes
123	Slashes up to seven.
124	Finishing Blow
125	Ends with a big slash all around (250%).
126	Piercing Arrow
127	An arrow that flies through foes.
128	Triple Shot
129	Fires three ways (70% each).
130	Heavy Arrow
131	Damage +30%, knocks hit foes far back.
132	Arrow Rain
133	Rains arrows on a crowd for 1.6s.
134	Wide Arrow Rain
135	Area +40%.
136	Long Arrow Rain
137	Lasts 3s.
138	Set Trap
139	Set a trap at your feet (up to 3). Foes who step on it take heavy damage and are rooted for 2s.
140	Exploding Trap
141	Explodes, hitting nearby foes too.
142	Snaring Trap
143	Roots for 3.5s, and foes stay slowed after.
144	Throw Net
145	Throw a net: roots foes there for 1s and slows them for 4s.
146	Sticky Net
147	Roots for 2.5s.
148	Thorn Net
149	Foes inside keep taking damage for 4s.
150	Retreat Shot
151	Roll back and shoot the nearest foe.
152	Parting Trap
153	Leaves a trap where you were.
154	Volley
155	Fires three arrows while retreating.
156	Call Hawk
157	A hawk flies with you for 12s, diving on a foe every second.
158	Two Hawks
159	Two hawks come.
160	Hunting Hawk
161	Foes the hawk dives on take 20% more damage.
162	Great Bell Strike
163	Hammer the ground ahead; the bell's toll hits all around.
164	Lingering Toll
165	Tremors stay where it hit for 3s, hitting again and again.
166	Double Toll
167	Strikes once more (the second has a smaller area).
168	Toll Wave
169	Ring the bell to send out a wave that pushes nearby foes away.
170	Triple Wave
171	The wave spreads three times (60% each).
172	Far Toll
173	Radius +50%.
174	Echo Clone
175	An echo clone appears for 8s and tolls around it every second.
176	Two Echoes
177	Two clones appear.
178	Bursting Echo
179	Releases a big wave when it fades (200%).
180	Resound
181	You and all your echo clones ring at once, hitting everything around.
182	Deep Resound
183	Hit foes are stunned for 1s.
184	Echo Call
185	Clones stay 3s longer.
186	Clang
187	A sharp metal clang stuns nearby foes for 1.5s.
188	Long Stun
189	Stuns for 2.5s.
190	Shattering Clang
191	Hit foes take 20% more damage for 6s.
192	Bell Shroud
193	A huge bell's shadow covers you for 5s; damage taken -50%.
194	Ringing Shroud
195	Each hit you take sends out a small wave.
196	Hardened Shroud
197	Damage taken -70%.
198	Earthshaker Stake
199	Leap high and drive your spear into the ground, hurling nearby foes away and stunning them. Near the edge, they tumble off.
200	Thousand Wind Cuts
201	Become the wind, sweeping between foes and slashing twelve times. You can't be hit meanwhile.
202	Open Hunting Ground
203	Lay six traps in a ring around you, then rain arrows over a wide area for 3s.
204	Sky Bell
205	Drop a giant bell from the sky, hitting nearby foes hard and stunning them for 2s. The bell then tolls three more times.
206	Great Wind Breath
207	A huge vortex sucks in nearby foes, keeps hitting them, then flings them all far away.
